<title>UK: Aquarius Group to list with 35.0 million stg tag.</title>
<headline>Aquarius Group to list with 35.0 million stg tag.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Aquarius Group Plc, a home improvement products group created by GWB Holdings Plc, said on Wednesday it planned to float on the London Stock Exchange by means of a placing valuing it at 35.0 million stg.</p>
<p>The float, sponsored by Charterhouse Tilney Securities, will raise up to 10.0 million stg net. The proceeds will be used to reduce Aquarius' borrowing and strengthen its balance sheet.</p>
<p>The issue is expected to be priced on Thursday December 12, with first dealings in the shares scheduled for Friday, December 20.</p>
<p>-- John Sutherland, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7945</p>
